        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7-7/8\" long sliding door flush pull has very clean lines. Concealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. This rectangular flush pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired. The finger opening has a nice easy grab lip. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel or Polished Stainless Steel  finish. Packaged with stainless steel mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-718-200_size.gif?v=1704354581\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/11-13-16-inch-long-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>11-13/16 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/15-3-4-inch-extra-long-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>15-3/4 Inch Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 7-7/8\" (200 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (56 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\" (13 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\" (11 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 6-11/16\" (170 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1-1/32\" (26 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 7-5/8\" (194 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-15/16\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
